# Build artefacts and caches. Everything else must stay: this is a pnpm
# workspace, and pnpm-workspace.yaml globs apps/* and packages/*, so removing
# a sibling package's package.json would break `pnpm install` at the root —
# which is where Vercel installs from when a project's Root Directory is a
# workspace member.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.swc
.git
scripts/results

# Gitignored, local-only WIP scaffold — never committed, so it's not a real
# sibling workspace member. The CLI uploads the local disk regardless of git
# tracking state, so without this it rides along into every deploy and its
# incomplete package.json breaks the frozen-lockfile install for every app,
# not just this one.
apps/community-api
